&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Senior Manager, Performance Media Analytics (CE &amp;amp; EE)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About SharkNinja&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, our mission is to positively impact people&#39;s lives every day in every home around the world. Through our Shark and Ninja brands, we create innovative products that disrupt categories and delight consumers. As we continue to grow across Central and Eastern Europe, we&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, Performance Media Analytics to help maximise the impact of our media investments. This is going to be based in our Frankfurt office 3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead media performance analytics and measurement across CE &amp;amp; EE markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver actionable insights to optimise media spend, campaign performance, and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, Ecommerce, Finance, and Agency teams to drive data-led decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reporting, dashboards, and performance reviews for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support attribution, incrementality testing, and other marketing effectiveness initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify trends, opportunities, and recommendations that improve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in media analytics, marketing analytics, or performance marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of digital media channels and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating complex data into clear business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with reporting and visualisation tools such as Power BI, Tableau, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial mindset with a passion for driving growth through data and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple markets and with agency partners is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
