&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure commercial teams have the tools, processes and insights required to act proactively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Reduce manual work and regional fragmentation by supporting standardised commercial infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
